{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-information-speed-of-light","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:information-speed-of-light","kind":"definition","title":"Speed of light as Lieb--Robinson velocity","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/ex-q-connection","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-operational-entropy","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-light-cone-affine"],"tags":["speed-of-light","information-theory","lieb-robinson","causal-structure","q-connection"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Information.speedOfLight","text":"information-speed-of-light.md","leanSource":"information-speed-of-light.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:information-speed-of-light\"></a><p>The <strong>speed of light</strong> at substrate parameter <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code> is the ratio of the spatial coupling weight <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q^{-1}</code> to the temporal coupling weight <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\hbar_q = 1 - q^{-1}</code> of the <a href=\"#ex:q-connection\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-connection</a>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  c_q  :=  \\frac{q^{-1}}{\\hbar_q}\n  =  \\frac{q^{-1}}{1 - q^{-1}}\n  =  \\frac{1}{q - 1}.</code></pre>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/information-speed-of-light.md","heading":"Definition","number":"22.4.1","page":"b/def-information-speed-of-light","qa":{"counts":{"pass":87,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":17,"unknown":0,"stale":77},"milnor":{"total":2,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.Information.speedOfLight","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/information-speed-of-light.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
